{
  "_note": "Horchow via Sovrn Commerce (merchant 666): the keyword sweep plan for scripts/build-neimanmarcus-catalog.mjs --banner horchow --via sovrn. PARCEL-ONLY (binding, Danny 2026-10-22): only the five parcel departments are swept -- bedding, bath, tabletop, small decor, kitchen -- and the ingest drops anything else (furniture, lighting, rugs, mirrors, wall art, outdoor pieces, a published weight over the site's parcel limit or a side over 100 cm; scripts/lib/nmg-banners.js parcelVerdict). Never add a furniture or lighting department here. Same request template and assumptions as the Neiman Marcus plan. includeMerchants is the Horchow GROUP id (HORCHOW_SOVRN_GROUP_ID or --merchant-group), never guessed.",
